@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "command:ListCommand" as List LOGIC_COLOR
participant "model:ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "filteredEmployees:FilteredList" as Filtered MODEL_COLOR
participant "sortedEmployees:SortedList" as Sorted MODEL_COLOR

note over Logic, List
AddressBookParser constructs ListCommand(false) for list,
or ListCommand(true) for exactly list archived.
Invalid arguments fail before execution and preserve the view/sort.
end note

Logic -> List : execute(model)
activate List
List -> Model : resetEmployeeSortOrder()
Model -> Sorted : setComparator(null)
note right of Sorted : Restore stored roster order.

alt list (active employees)
    List -> Model : updateFilteredEmployeeList(\nPREDICATE_SHOW_ALL_EMPLOYEES)
    Model -> Filtered : setPredicate(active status AND predicate)
else list archived
    List -> Model : showArchivedEmployees()
    Model -> Filtered : setPredicate(Employee::isArchived)
end

note over Filtered, Sorted
The existing observable view updates EmployeeListPanel's ListView.
Cards are numbered from 1 in the resulting view.
No employee record is changed or reloaded from disk.
end note

List -> Model : getFilteredEmployeeList()
Model --> List : sorted view
alt view is non-empty
    List -> List : choose active / archived success message
else empty archive view
    List -> List : choose MESSAGE_EMPTY_ARCHIVE
else empty active view
    List -> Model : getArchivedEmployeeCount()
    Model --> List : archivedCount
    alt archivedCount == 0
        List -> List : choose MESSAGE_EMPTY_LIST (add guidance)
    else archivedCount > 0
        List -> List : choose MESSAGE_EMPTY_ACTIVE_WITH_ARCHIVED\n(count and list archived hint)
    end
end
List --> Logic : CommandResult(feedback)
deactivate List

note over Logic, Model
HistoryAction.NONE: no checkpoint, history commit or employee-file save.
Available undo/redo steps remain unchanged.
end note
@enduml
